# Domain enforcement — GoShip Site contracts

## Locked (do not rewrite)
- `lib/blog.ts` — BlogPost schema, MD↔seo_documents merge, Hub contract
- SEO surfaces that call `@goship/core`: `app/sitemap.ts`, `app/robots.ts`, `app/llms.txt/route.ts`
- Plugin flags: `config/plugins.ts`

## Allowed (Roncyo skin)
- `components/blog/*` — layout, typography, classNames
- Marketing pages: `/`, `/products`, `/labs`, `/about`, `/contact`
- Legal: `/privacy-policy`, `/apps/*/privacy|support`

## Rules
- Import auth / billing / telemetry / SEO builders from `@goship/core` — do not fork
- Upgrade SDK via `npm run pack:goship` (local tarball), not by copying source into this repo
- Hub SEO writes `seo_documents`; `content/blog/*.md` is seed / offline fallback
- Do not invent a second CMS or frontmatter parser
